        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>with our </strong><em><strong>Quality Transfer</strong></em><strong>s that'll take your business to the next level.</strong></p><p>SHEmakes is a family-owned, small business located in London, Ontario, Canada. <br/><br/>Our <a href=\"/collections/custom-dtf-for-fabric\" title=\"Custom DTF Transfers (for fabric)\">DTF</a> and <a href=\"/collections/custom-uv-dtf\" title=\"Custom UV DTF\">UV DTF</a> transfers are carefully made using the latest commercial printing equipment. Customer satisfaction is always guaranteed.</p><p>We offer <a href=\"/pages/free-local-pickup-in-london-ontario-and-st-thomas-ontario-dtf-transfers-and-uv-dtf\" title=\"Free local pickup in London Ontario and St. Thomas Ontario - DTF Transfers and UV DTF\">free local pickup</a> in London, Ontario or St. Thomas, Ontario.<br/><br/>We ship across Canada and the USA for discounted flat rates or free shipping for orders over $150.<br/><br/>Try our transfers today and see the difference!</p>",
            "letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_color_scheme": "background-2"
          }
        }
      },
